(6784276, 1018469, 140537, '<td valign="top">This one was done right. Creepy.</td>', 'This one was done right. Creepy.', '2012-06-02 19:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784278, 1018709, 140537, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. Tweaking up the score. This just feels different and I like that. Different take on the challenge and different use of photoshop. Thanks.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. Tweaking up the score. This just feels different and I like that. Different take on the challenge and different use of photoshop. Thanks.', '2012-06-02 19:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784287, 1018498, 140537, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. Is the title ironic?<br/>Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t get it. Is the title ironic?Sorry.', '2012-06-02 19:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784341, 1018709, 114285, '<td valign="top">Yes very harsh is this century, but not sure I can see it here in your images, still I like the feel to this.</td>', 'Yes very harsh is this century, but not sure I can see it here in your images, still I like the feel to this.', '2012-06-02 22:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784479, 1018291, 141826, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!!!</td>', 'Great Shot!!!', '2012-06-03 03:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784482, 1017722, 141826, '<td valign="top">Dead End!!!!!!</td>', 'Dead End!!!!!!', '2012-06-03 03:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784489, 1018493, 141826, '<td valign="top">Amazing .... 10!!!!!!!</td>', 'Amazing .... 10!!!!!!!', '2012-06-03 03:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784521, 1018517, 92577, '<td valign="top">As a fan of mythology and fantasy art I am immediately drawn to this image. I like the idea, composition and tones you''ve used. Good luck</td>', 'As a fan of mythology and fantasy art I am immediately drawn to this image. I like the idea, composition and tones you''ve used. Good luck', '2012-06-03 07:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784715, 1018295, 83901, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge!</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge!', '2012-06-03 13:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784717, 1018678, 83901, '<td valign="top">One of my top three!</td>', 'One of my top three!', '2012-06-03 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784748, 1018317, 132996, '<td valign="top">I''m sure people have said it already: too overprocessed, saturation, sharpening...it''s overwhelming. Maybe it''s because you have a poor camera, and that''s alright. In that case, you have to rely heavily on a stunning composition, and unfortunately, this image doesn''t have that either. Keep working on it. :)</td>', 'I''m sure people have said it already: too overprocessed, saturation, sharpening...it''s overwhelming. Maybe it''s because you have a poor camera, and that''s alright. In that case, you have to rely heavily on a stunning composition, and unfortunately, this image doesn''t have that either. Keep working on it. :)', '2012-06-03 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784750, 1018603, 132996, '<td valign="top">My eyes don''t really know where to look in this image (no real focal point, I''m bouncing around everywhere). I look at the moss covered rocks and don''t see the "harsh environment". I see the flourishing green and see how many organisms are able to survive. The wood is even worn away, probably from insects eating it.<br/> <br/>I like your attempt at framing with the posts, but there just isn''t a subject to frame which matches the challenge description.</td>', 'My eyes don''t really know where to look in this image (no real focal point, I''m bouncing around everywhere). I look at the moss covered rocks and don''t see the "harsh environment". I see the flourishing green and see how many organisms are able to survive. The wood is even worn away, probably from insects eating it. I like your attempt at framing with the posts, but there just isn''t a subject to frame which matches the challenge description.', '2012-06-03 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784753, 1018601, 132996, '<td valign="top">The image is overprocessed to me. It borders cartoonish. This doesn''t ruin the image though. I like your subject but I think you need to examine it a bit more closely (walk around, find some rousing angles). The composition doesn''t really impact the viewer, it''s rather standard.</td>', 'The image is overprocessed to me. It borders cartoonish. This doesn''t ruin the image though. I like your subject but I think you need to examine it a bit more closely (walk around, find some rousing angles). The composition doesn''t really impact the viewer, it''s rather standard.', '2012-06-03 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784756, 1018542, 132996, '<td valign="top">The centered pole draws attention to a contrast which maybe you tried to make with the selective red...however there doesn''t seem to be any contrast between the two lanes; to me, this creates a disconnect. I''m looking and looking for the harsh element of this image...but I can''t find it, no man standing on the median looking to cross, no crash, no fear, chaos, confusion. There''s too much to look at in this image which seems unrelated.</td>', 'The centered pole draws attention to a contrast which maybe you tried to make with the selective red...however there doesn''t seem to be any contrast between the two lanes; to me, this creates a disconnect. I''m looking and looking for the harsh element of this image...but I can''t find it, no man standing on the median looking to cross, no crash, no fear, chaos, confusion. There''s too much to look at in this image which seems unrelated.', '2012-06-03 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784802, 1018568, 56502, '<td valign="top">Probably less harsh than 25 years ago, though. Anyway - nice shot.</td>', 'Probably less harsh than 25 years ago, though. Anyway - nice shot.', '2012-06-03 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784803, 1018601, 56502, '<td valign="top">Can''t be very harsh with those bottles of beer :-)</td>', 'Can''t be very harsh with those bottles of beer :-)', '2012-06-03 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6784804, 1018656, 56502, '<td valign="top">Are they?</td>', 'Are they?', '2012-06-03 16:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785023, 1017598, 132996, '<td valign="top">I think you picked a unique subject: herbivory, however, your composition is sore, I feel. I think a more striking connection needs to be made between the insect-eaten leaves and the thorns. Many probably gloss over the leaves and only see the thorns before moving on. One way to enhance the leaves is probably a shot from underneath, where the light is shining through the holes; while the thorned stem could be framed as some sort of leading element.</td>', 'I think you picked a unique subject: herbivory, however, your composition is sore, I feel. I think a more striking connection needs to be made between the insect-eaten leaves and the thorns. Many probably gloss over the leaves and only see the thorns before moving on. One way to enhance the leaves is probably a shot from underneath, where the light is shining through the holes; while the thorned stem could be framed as some sort of leading element.', '2012-06-03 22:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785045, 1018605, 132996, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the harsh environment in this image. In fact, there''s hope amongst these dead trees: grass, bushes, a line of foliage in the back. Also, your processing is rather peculiar to me, it almost resembles ripples in water (another sign of life). More emphasis needs to be placed on the desolate, "unusuable" nature of the land with your composition, cutting out the greenery ideally. Also, the image only being 600 pixels tall counts against you.</td>', 'I don''t see the harsh environment in this image. In fact, there''s hope amongst these dead trees: grass, bushes, a line of foliage in the back. Also, your processing is rather peculiar to me, it almost resembles ripples in water (another sign of life). More emphasis needs to be placed on the desolate, "unusuable" nature of the land with your composition, cutting out the greenery ideally. Also, the image only being 600 pixels tall counts against you.', '2012-06-03 22:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785109, 1018678, 99412, '<td valign="top">Definitely a harsh looking environment and beautifully done.   10</td>', 'Definitely a harsh looking environment and beautifully done.   10', '2012-06-03 23:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785430, 1018647, 35467, '<td valign="top">Wicked!</td>', 'Wicked!', '2012-06-04 07:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
