(6810393, 1018269, 96721, '<td valign="top">Wow Timfy I didn''t put this down as yours!<br/> <br/>I remembered seeing this shot in voting and had an urge to see where it came as I hadn''t seen it on the front page after the challenge ended. So it must have resonated with me :) <br/> <br/>Gave you an 8 and thought it was an excellent take on the challenge - very nicely done.</td>', 'Wow Timfy I didn''t put this down as yours! I remembered seeing this shot in voting and had an urge to see where it came as I hadn''t seen it on the front page after the challenge ended. So it must have resonated with me :)  Gave you an 8 and thought it was an excellent take on the challenge - very nicely done.', '2012-07-06 03:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
